Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 11:47:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03251/11362] [outer-loop] remove gemma4-agentic harness entry
 (eval done: 9B kept)

The 2026-06-21 candidate (yuxinlu1/gemma-4-12B-agentic) lost to qwen3.5-9b-mtp on Layer-B
grounding (60% vs 90% over ka59+tn36 x5 seeds; tied ka59 4/5 but collapsed tn36 2/5 vs 5/5),
so the generator stays frozen at Qwen3.5-9B-MTP. Removes the experimental MODELS entry that a
conductor git-add-A checkpoint swept in; deletes the one-off model. Partial commit, only this file.
---
 scripts/experiments/arc3_layerb_ar_model_test.py | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/scripts/experiments/arc3_layerb_ar_model_test.py b/scripts/experiments/arc3_layerb_ar_model_test.py
index 98a71e9fb2..b9009369c7 100644
--- a/scripts/experiments/arc3_layerb_ar_model_test.py
+++ b/scripts/experiments/arc3_layerb_ar_model_test.py
@@ -47,9 +47,6 @@ MODELS = {
     # coder beats the small Q4 models on accuracy. Qwen3.6-based, so /no_think applies.
     "qwopus-q3km": ("models--Jackrong--Qwopus3.6-27B-Coder-MTP-GGUF/snapshots/*/Qwopus3.6-27B-Coder-MTP-Q3_K_M.gguf", "/no_think\n"),
     "gemma-12b": ("models--unsloth--gemma-4-12B-it-GGUF/snapshots/*/gemma-4-12b-it-Q4_K_M.gguf", None),
-    # candidate (operator 2026-06-21): gemma-4-12B agentic/tau2/composer fine-tune (yuxinlu1) -- tests
-    # whether an agentic-tuned gemma-4-12B beats base Qwen3.5-9B-MTP on Layer-B grounding for the ARC generator.
-    "gemma4-agentic": ("models--yuxinlu1--gemma-4-12B-agentic*GGUF/snapshots/*/gemma4-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf", None),
 }
 
 
